{
  "name": "Infinite Leads: new leads to a lemlist campaign",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e01",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -460,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 400,
        "height": 600,
        "content": "## Infinite Leads: new leads to lemlist\n\nEvaboot sends each run of one recurring export to this webhook. Every lead with an email joins your lemlist campaign.\n\n1. Open **New leads from Evaboot** and copy the **Production URL**. Give it to your agent: it connects the URL to the recurring export for this signal.\n2. Open **Your settings** and paste the lemlist campaign id (the `cam_...` part of the campaign's URL). Open **Add the lead to the campaign** and connect your lemlist account (lemlist API key).\n3. Activate the workflow.\n\nLeads lemlist already has, or has unsubscribed, are skipped. Any other refusal fails the execution, so you see it and can retry it under **Executions**: Evaboot never sends the same batch twice.\n\nImport it once per signal, so each signal keeps its own campaign."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e02",
      "name": "New leads from Evaboot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "2f6c1d8e-7a4b-4c1e-9f3d-5b8a0e2c4d61",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "infinite-leads",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e09",
      "name": "Your settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {},
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "7b1c2d3e-4f5a-4b6c-8d7e-9f0a1b2c3d4e",
              "name": "lemlistCampaignId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "YOUR_LEMLIST_CAMPAIGN_ID"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e03",
      "name": "One lead at a time",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "body.prospects",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e04",
      "name": "Leads with an email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "Evaboot leaves Email blank unless the address is deliverable.",
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "8c1e2f3a-1b2c-4d5e-8f90-a1b2c3d4e5f6",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json['Email'] }}",
              "rightValue": ""
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e05",
      "name": "Add the lead to the campaign",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        0
      ],
      "notes": "An HTTP request instead of the lemlist node, because the lemlist node hides lemlist's error text and a lead lemlist already has could not be told apart from a real refusal.",
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.lemlist.com/api/campaigns/{{ $('Your settings').first().json.lemlistCampaignId }}/leads/{{ encodeURIComponent($json['Email']) }}",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "lemlistApi",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "deduplicate",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "firstName",
              "value": "={{ $json['First Name'] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "lastName",
              "value": "={{ $json['Last Name'] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "jobTitle",
              "value": "={{ $json['Current Job'] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyName",
              "value": "={{ $json['Company Name'] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "companyDomain",
              "value": "={{ $json['Company Domain'] }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "linkedinUrl",
              "value": "={{ $json['Linkedin URL Public'] }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "lemlistApi": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "lemlist account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e06",
      "name": "Already in lemlist or unsubscribed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "combinator": "or",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "9d2f3a4b-2c3d-4e5f-9a01-b2c3d4e5f6a7",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.error?.description ?? '') + ' ' + ($json.error?.cause?.message ?? '') }}",
              "rightValue": "already"
            },
            {
              "id": "0e3a4b5c-3d4e-4f5a-8b12-c3d4e5f6a7b8",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ ($json.error?.description ?? '') + ' ' + ($json.error?.cause?.message ?? '') }}",
              "rightValue": "graveyard"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e07",
      "name": "Skip it",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "5a0d2c1e-4b8f-4e43-9d0b-1f6a2b7c9e08",
      "name": "Fail the execution",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1320,
        220
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "=lemlist refused {{ $json['Email'] }}: {{ $json.error?.description ?? $json.error?.message }}"
      }
    }
  ],
